  {"id":"ar-027","mode":"method","topic":"Aritmetika","difficulty":"Medium","type":"numeric","question":"Harga barang Rp100.000 naik 20% kemudian turun 20%. Harga akhirnya adalah Rp ... (tulis angka saja)","answer":"96000","explanation":"100.000 × 1,2 = 120.000; 120.000 × 0,8 = 96.000. Faktor akhir 0,96.","timeMultiplier":1.2,"tags":["persen","mixed-skill"]},
  {"id":"ar-028","mode":"method","topic":"Aritmetika","difficulty":"Medium","type":"numeric","question":"Perbandingan umur ayah dan anak adalah 7 : 2. Jika selisih umur mereka 35 tahun, umur anak adalah ... tahun","answer":"14","explanation":"Selisih 5 bagian = 35, jadi 1 bagian = 7. Umur anak = 2 × 7 = 14.","timeMultiplier":1.2,"tags":["perbandingan","mixed-skill"]},
  {"id":"ar-029","mode":"method","topic":"Aritmetika","difficulty":"Hard","type":"numeric","question":"Sebuah mobil pergi dengan kecepatan 60 km/jam dan pulang melalui jalan yang sama dengan 40 km/jam. Kecepatan rata-rata seluruh perjalanan adalah ... km/jam","answer":"48","explanation":"Rata-rata harmonik: 2·60·40/(60 + 40) = 4800/100 = 48.","timeMultiplier":1.5,"tags":["kecepatan","rata-rata harmonik","mixed-skill"]},
  {"id":"ar-030","mode":"method","topic":"Aritmetika","difficulty":"Medium","type":"multiple","question":"Pak A menyelesaikan suatu pekerjaan dalam 6 hari dan Pak B dalam 3 hari. Jika bekerja bersama, pekerjaan selesai dalam ...","options":["1 hari","2 hari","3 hari","4,5 hari"],"answer":"2 hari","explanation":"1/6 + 1/3 = 1/2 pekerjaan per hari, sehingga selesai dalam 2 hari.","timeMultiplier":1.2,"tags":["pekerjaan","mixed-skill"]},
  {"id":"ar-031","mode":"method","topic":"Aritmetika","difficulty":"Medium","type":"numeric","question":"Modal Rp1.000.000 dibungakan dengan bunga tunggal 6% per tahun. Besar bunga setelah 8 bulan adalah Rp ... (tulis angka saja)","answer":"40000","explanation":"Bunga = 1.000.000 × 6% × 8/12 = 60.000 × 2/3 = 40.000.","timeMultiplier":1.2,"tags":["bunga tunggal","mixed-skill"]},
  {"id":"ar-032","mode":"method","topic":"Aritmetika","difficulty":"Easy","type":"multiple","question":"Pada peta berskala 1 : 500.000, jarak dua kota adalah 3 cm. Jarak sebenarnya adalah ...","options":["1,5 km","15 km","150 km","7,5 km"],"answer":"15 km","explanation":"3 × 500.000 = 1.500.000 cm = 15 km.","timeMultiplier":0.9,"tags":["skala","mixed-skill"]},
  {"id":"al-009","mode":"method","topic":"Aljabar","difficulty":"Easy","type":"multiple","question":"Bentuk jabar dari (x + 5)² adalah ...","options":["x² + 25","x² + 10x + 25","x² + 5x + 25","x² + 10x + 10"],"answer":"x² + 10x + 25","explanation":"(a + b)² = a² + 2ab + b², sehingga x² + 10x + 25.","timeMultiplier":0.9,"tags":["identitas","kuadrat sempurna"]},
  {"id":"al-010","mode":"method","topic":"Aljabar","difficulty":"Easy","type":"multiple","question":"Faktorisasi dari x² − 49 adalah ...","options":["(x − 7)(x − 7)","(x − 7)(x + 7)","(x + 7)(x + 7)","(x − 49)(x + 1)"],"answer":"(x − 7)(x + 7)","explanation":"a² − b² = (a − b)(a + b) dengan a = x dan b = 7.","timeMultiplier":0.9,"tags":["faktorisasi","selisih kuadrat"]},
  {"id":"al-011","mode":"method","topic":"Aljabar","difficulty":"Easy","type":"multiple","question":"Jumlah akar-akar persamaan x² − 5x + 6 = 0 adalah ...","options":["−5","5","6","−6"],"answer":"5","explanation":"x₁ + x₂ = −b/a = 5 (akarnya 2 dan 3).","timeMultiplier":0.9,"tags":["akar persamaan kuadrat","Vieta"]},
  {"id":"al-012","mode":"method","topic":"Aljabar","difficulty":"Easy","type":"multiple","question":"Hasil kali akar-akar persamaan x² − 7x + 12 = 0 adalah ...","options":["−12","7","12","−7"],"answer":"12","explanation":"x₁ · x₂ = c/a = 12 (akarnya 3 dan 4).","timeMultiplier":0.9,"tags":["akar persamaan kuadrat","Vieta"]},
  {"id":"al-013","mode":"method","topic":"Aljabar","difficulty":"Easy","type":"multiple","question":"Gradien garis yang melalui titik (1, 2) dan (3, 8) adalah ...","options":["2","3","4","6"],"answer":"3","explanation":"m = (8 − 2)/(3 − 1) = 6/2 = 3.","timeMultiplier":0.9,"tags":["gradien","garis lurus"]},
  {"id":"al-014","mode":"method","topic":"Aljabar","difficulty":"Easy","type":"multiple","question":"Persamaan garis dengan gradien 2 yang melalui titik (0, 3) adalah ...","options":["y = 3x + 2","y = 2x + 3","y = 2x − 3","y = −2x + 3"],"answer":"y = 2x + 3","explanation":"y = mx + c dengan m = 2 dan c = 3 (titik potong sumbu-y).","timeMultiplier":0.9,"tags":["persamaan garis","garis lurus"]},
  {"id":"al-015","mode":"method","topic":"Aljabar","difficulty":"Medium","type":"numeric","question":"Diskriminan dari persamaan x² − 4x + 1 = 0 adalah ...","answer":"12","explanation":"D = b² − 4ac = 16 − 4 = 12.","timeMultiplier":1.0,"tags":["diskriminan","persamaan kuadrat"]},
  {"id":"al-016","mode":"method","topic":"Aljabar","difficulty":"Easy","type":"multiple","question":"Suku pertama barisan aritmetika adalah 3 dan bedanya 4. Suku ke-10 adalah ...","options":["36","39","43","40"],"answer":"39","explanation":"Uₙ = a + (n − 1)b = 3 + 9 × 4 = 39.","timeMultiplier":1.0,"tags":["barisan aritmetika"]},
  {"id":"al-017","mode":"method","topic":"Aljabar","difficulty":"Medium","type":"numeric","question":"Pada barisan geometri 2, 6, 18, ... suku ke-5 adalah ...","answer":"162","explanation":"Uₙ = a·rⁿ⁻¹ = 2 × 3⁴ = 2 × 81 = 162.","timeMultiplier":1.2,"tags":["barisan geometri"]},
  {"id":"al-018","mode":"method","topic":"Aljabar","difficulty":"Medium","type":"numeric","question":"Jumlah 10 suku pertama deret aritmetika dengan a = 2 dan b = 3 adalah ...","answer":"155","explanation":"Sₙ = n/2 (2a + (n − 1)b) = 5(4 + 27) = 155.","timeMultiplier":1.2,"tags":["deret aritmetika"]},
  {"id":"al-019","mode":"method","topic":"Aljabar","difficulty":"Medium","type":"multiple","question":"Jika x + y = 10 dan x − y = 4, maka nilai xy adalah ...","options":["10","21","24","40"],"answer":"21","explanation":"Jumlahkan: 2x = 14 → x = 7, lalu y = 3. xy = 21.","timeMultiplier":1.2,"tags":["sistem persamaan"]},
  {"id":"al-020","mode":"method","topic":"Aljabar","difficulty":"Hard","type":"multiple","question":"Jika x + 1/x = 5, maka nilai x² + 1/x² adalah ...","options":["23","25","27","21"],"answer":"23","explanation":"(x + 1/x)² = x² + 2 + 1/x² = 25, sehingga x² + 1/x² = 23.","timeMultiplier":1.5,"tags":["identitas","manipulasi aljabar"]},
  {"id":"al-021","mode":"method","topic":"Aljabar","difficulty":"Easy","type":"numeric","question":"Jika a + b = 10 dan a − b = 3, maka a² − b² = ...","answer":"30","explanation":"a² − b² = (a + b)(a − b) = 10 × 3 = 30.","timeMultiplier":0.9,"tags":["selisih kuadrat","identitas"]},
  {"id":"al-022","mode":"method","topic":"Aljabar","difficulty":"Medium","type":"numeric","question":"Jika a + b = 7 dan ab = 10, maka a² + b² = ...","answer":"29","explanation":"a² + b² = (a + b)² − 2ab = 49 − 20 = 29.","timeMultiplier":1.2,"tags":["identitas","manipulasi aljabar"]},
  {"id":"ge-007","mode":"method","topic":"Geometri","difficulty":"Easy","type":"multiple","question":"Segitiga siku-siku memiliki sisi siku-siku 9 cm dan 12 cm. Panjang hipotenusanya adalah ... cm","options":["13","14","15","21"],"answer":"15","explanation":"√(9² + 12²) = √(81 + 144) = √225 = 15 (kelipatan tripel 3-4-5).","timeMultiplier":0.9,"tags":["Pythagoras"]},
  {"id":"ge-008","mode":"method","topic":"Geometri","difficulty":"Medium","type":"numeric","question":"Segitiga siku-siku memiliki hipotenusa 26 cm dan satu sisi siku-siku 10 cm. Sisi siku-siku lainnya adalah ... cm","answer":"24","explanation":"Tripel 5-12-13 dikali 2: 10, 24, 26. Cek: 26² − 10² = 676 − 100 = 576 = 24².","timeMultiplier":1.0,"tags":["Pythagoras","tripel Pythagoras"]},
  {"id":"ge-009","mode":"method","topic":"Geometri","difficulty":"Medium","type":"numeric","question":"Luas segitiga dengan panjang sisi 13 cm, 14 cm, dan 15 cm adalah ... cm²","answer":"84","explanation":"Heron: s = 21, L = √(21·8·7·6) = √7056 = 84.","timeMultiplier":1.3,"tags":["rumus Heron","luas"]},
  {"id":"ge-010","mode":"method","topic":"Geometri","difficulty":"Easy","type":"multiple","question":"Luas trapesium dengan sisi sejajar 8 cm dan 14 cm serta tinggi 6 cm adalah ... cm²","options":["48","66","132","84"],"answer":"66","explanation":"L = ½(a + b)t = ½ × 22 × 6 = 66.","timeMultiplier":0.9,"tags":["luas","trapesium"]},
  {"id":"ge-011","mode":"method","topic":"Geometri","difficulty":"Easy","type":"multiple","question":"Luas belah ketupat dengan panjang diagonal 10 cm dan 24 cm adalah ... cm²","options":["60","120","130","240"],"answer":"120","explanation":"L = ½ × d₁ × d₂ = ½ × 10 × 24 = 120.","timeMultiplier":0.9,"tags":["luas","belah ketupat"]},
  {"id":"ge-012","mode":"method","topic":"Geometri","difficulty":"Medium","type":"numeric","question":"Volume tabung dengan jari-jari 7 cm dan tinggi 10 cm (π = 22/7) adalah ... cm³","answer":"1540","explanation":"V = πr²t = 22/7 × 49 × 10 = 22 × 7 × 10 = 1540.","timeMultiplier":1.1,"tags":["volume","tabung"]},
  {"id":"ge-013","mode":"method","topic":"Geometri","difficulty":"Medium","type":"multiple","question":"Volume kerucut dengan jari-jari 3 cm dan tinggi 4 cm (π = 3,14) adalah ... cm³","options":["12,56","37,68","75,36","113,04"],"answer":"37,68","explanation":"V = ⅓πr²t = ⅓ × 3,14 × 9 × 4 = 3,14 × 12 = 37,68.","timeMultiplier":1.2,"tags":["volume","kerucut"]},
  {"id":"ge-014","mode":"method","topic":"Geometri","difficulty":"Easy","type":"multiple","question":"Luas permukaan kubus dengan rusuk 6 cm adalah ... cm²","options":["36","144","216","180"],"answer":"216","explanation":"L = 6s² = 6 × 36 = 216.","timeMultiplier":0.8,"tags":["luas permukaan","kubus"]},
  {"id":"ge-015","mode":"method","topic":"Geometri","difficulty":"Medium","type":"multiple","question":"Panjang diagonal ruang kubus dengan rusuk 6 cm adalah ... cm","options":["6√2","6√3","12","3√6"],"answer":"6√3","explanation":"Diagonal ruang = s√3 = 6√3.","timeMultiplier":1.1,"tags":["diagonal ruang","kubus"]},
  {"id":"ge-016","mode":"method","topic":"Geometri","difficulty":"Medium","type":"numeric","question":"Panjang busur lingkaran dengan sudut pusat 90° dan jari-jari 14 cm (π = 22/7) adalah ... cm","answer":"22","explanation":"Busur = 90/360 × 2πr = ¼ × 2 × 22/7 × 14 = ¼ × 88 = 22.","timeMultiplier":1.2,"tags":["busur","lingkaran"]},
  {"id":"ge-017","mode":"method","topic":"Geometri","difficulty":"Easy","type":"multiple","question":"Sudut pusat suatu lingkaran 100°. Besar sudut keliling yang menghadap busur yang sama adalah ...","options":["25°","50°","100°","200°"],"answer":"50°","explanation":"Sudut keliling = ½ sudut pusat = 50°.","timeMultiplier":0.9,"tags":["sudut keliling","lingkaran"]},
  {"id":"ge-018","mode":"method","topic":"Geometri","difficulty":"Medium","type":"multiple","question":"Banyak diagonal pada segi sepuluh beraturan adalah ...","options":["30","35","40","45"],"answer":"35","explanation":"n(n − 3)/2 = 10 × 7/2 = 35.","timeMultiplier":1.1,"tags":["diagonal","segi-n"]},
  {"id":"ge-019","mode":"method","topic":"Geometri","difficulty":"Medium","type":"multiple","question":"△ABC sebangun dengan △DEF. Jika AB = 6, DE = 9, dan BC = 8, maka EF = ...","options":["10","11","12","16"],"answer":"12","explanation":"Perbandingan 9/6 = 3/2, maka EF = 8 × 3/2 = 12.","timeMultiplier":1.1,"tags":["kesebangunan"]},
  {"id":"ge-020","mode":"method","topic":"Geometri","difficulty":"Medium","type":"multiple","question":"Dari titik yang berjarak 13 cm dari pusat lingkaran berjari-jari 5 cm ditarik garis singgung. Panjang garis singgung tersebut adalah ... cm","options":["8","10","12","13"],"answer":"12","explanation":"Garis singgung = √(13² − 5²) = √144 = 12.","timeMultiplier":1.2,"tags":["garis singgung","Pythagoras"]},
  {"id":"ge-021","mode":"method","topic":"Geometri","difficulty":"Medium","type":"numeric","question":"Keliling sebuah lingkaran 44 cm (π = 22/7). Luas lingkaran tersebut adalah ... cm²","answer":"154","explanation":"2πr = 44 → r = 7. L = πr² = 22/7 × 49 = 154.","timeMultiplier":1.2,"tags":["lingkaran","luas","keliling"]},
  {"id":"ge-022","mode":"method","topic":"Geometri","difficulty":"Medium","type":"multiple","question":"Luas segitiga sama sisi dengan panjang sisi 8 cm adalah ... cm²","options":["8√3","16√3","32√3","16√2"],"answer":"16√3","explanation":"L = (s²√3)/4 = 64√3/4 = 16√3.","timeMultiplier":1.2,"tags":["luas","segitiga sama sisi"]},
  {"id":"nt-007","mode":"method","topic":"Teori Bilangan","difficulty":"Medium","type":"multiple","question":"Banyak faktor positif dari 72 adalah ...","options":["8","10","12","14"],"answer":"12","explanation":"72 = 2³ × 3², banyak faktor = (3 + 1)(2 + 1) = 12.","timeMultiplier":1.2,"tags":["faktor","faktorisasi prima"]},
  {"id":"nt-008","mode":"method","topic":"Teori Bilangan","difficulty":"Medium","type":"numeric","question":"Angka satuan dari 7²⁰²⁶ adalah ...","answer":"9","explanation":"Satuan pangkat 7 berulang 7, 9, 3, 1 (periode 4). 2026 mod 4 = 2, sehingga satuannya 9.","timeMultiplier":1.3,"tags":["angka satuan","pola"]},
  {"id":"nt-009","mode":"method","topic":"Teori Bilangan","difficulty":"Medium","type":"multiple","question":"FPB dua bilangan adalah 6 dan KPK-nya 60. Jika salah satu bilangan itu 12, bilangan lainnya adalah ...","options":["18","24","30","36"],"answer":"30","explanation":"FPB × KPK = hasil kali: 6 × 60 = 360, maka bilangan lain = 360 : 12 = 30.","timeMultiplier":1.2,"tags":["FPB","KPK"]},
  {"id":"nt-010","mode":"method","topic":"Teori Bilangan","difficulty":"Hard","type":"multiple","question":"Sisa pembagian 2¹⁰⁰ oleh 3 adalah ...","options":["0","1","2","4"],"answer":"1","explanation":"2 ≡ −1 (mod 3), sehingga 2¹⁰⁰ ≡ (−1)¹⁰⁰ = 1.","timeMultiplier":1.4,"tags":["modulo","sisa pembagian"]},
  {"id":"nt-011","mode":"method","topic":"Teori Bilangan","difficulty":"Medium","type":"numeric","question":"Jumlah semua faktor positif dari 28 adalah ...","answer":"56","explanation":"Faktor: 1, 2, 4, 7, 14, 28. Jumlahnya 56 (bilangan sempurna: 2 × 28).","timeMultiplier":1.2,"tags":["faktor","bilangan sempurna"]},
  {"id":"nt-012","mode":"method","topic":"Teori Bilangan","difficulty":"Medium","type":"numeric","question":"Banyak bilangan bulat dari 1 sampai 100 yang habis dibagi 3 atau 5 adalah ...","answer":"47","explanation":"Prinsip inklusi-eksklusi: 33 + 20 − 6 = 47 (kelipatan 15 ada 6).","timeMultiplier":1.4,"tags":["inklusi-eksklusi","kelipatan"]},
  {"id":"nt-013","mode":"method","topic":"Teori Bilangan","difficulty":"Medium","type":"multiple","question":"Sisa pembagian 1234 oleh 11 adalah ...","options":["0","1","2","3"],"answer":"2","explanation":"Jumlah bergantian digit dari kanan: 4 − 3 + 2 − 1 = 2, maka sisa 2. (11 × 112 = 1232)","timeMultiplier":1.2,"tags":["sisa pembagian","aturan habis dibagi 11"]},
  {"id":"sp-005","mode":"method","topic":"Statistika & Peluang","difficulty":"Medium","type":"numeric","question":"Banyak susunan berbeda dari huruf-huruf pada kata \"BANANA\" adalah ...","answer":"60","explanation":"Permutasi unsur sama: 6!/(3! · 2!) = 720/12 = 60.","timeMultiplier":1.3,"tags":["permutasi","unsur sama"]},
  {"id":"sp-006","mode":"method","topic":"Statistika & Peluang","difficulty":"Easy","type":"multiple","question":"Dari 6 siswa akan dipilih 2 orang sebagai perwakilan. Banyak cara memilihnya adalah ...","options":["12","15","30","36"],"answer":"15","explanation":"C(6,2) = 6 × 5 / 2 = 15.","timeMultiplier":1.0,"tags":["kombinasi"]},
  {"id":"sp-007","mode":"method","topic":"Statistika & Peluang","difficulty":"Medium","type":"multiple","question":"Dua dadu dilempar bersamaan. Peluang jumlah mata dadu 8 adalah ...","options":["1/6","5/36","1/9","7/36"],"answer":"5/36","explanation":"Pasangan: (2,6), (3,5), (4,4), (5,3), (6,2) = 5 dari 36.","timeMultiplier":1.2,"tags":["peluang","dua dadu"]},
  {"id":"sp-008","mode":"method","topic":"Statistika & Peluang","difficulty":"Medium","type":"numeric","question":"Rata-rata 5 bilangan adalah 12. Jika ditambah satu bilangan, rata-ratanya menjadi 13. Bilangan yang ditambahkan adalah ...","answer":"18","explanation":"Jumlah baru = 6 × 13 = 78, jumlah lama = 5 × 12 = 60, selisih = 18.","timeMultiplier":1.2,"tags":["rata-rata"]},
  {"id":"sp-009","mode":"method","topic":"Statistika & Peluang","difficulty":"Easy","type":"multiple","question":"Banyak cara menyusun 4 orang dalam satu barisan adalah ...","options":["12","16","24","48"],"answer":"24","explanation":"4! = 4 × 3 × 2 × 1 = 24.","timeMultiplier":0.9,"tags":["permutasi","faktorial"]},
  {"id":"sp-010","mode":"method","topic":"Statistika & Peluang","difficulty":"Easy","type":"multiple","question":"Sebuah kartu diambil acak dari satu set kartu bridge (52 kartu). Peluang terambil kartu As adalah ...","options":["1/13","1/26","1/52","4/13"],"answer":"1/13","explanation":"Ada 4 As dari 52 kartu: 4/52 = 1/13.","timeMultiplier":0.9,"tags":["peluang"]},
  {"id":"sp-011","mode":"method","topic":"Statistika & Peluang","difficulty":"Easy","type":"numeric","question":"Median dari data 2, 4, 6, 8, 10, 12 adalah ...","answer":"7","explanation":"Banyak data genap: median = rata-rata dua nilai tengah = (6 + 8)/2 = 7.","timeMultiplier":0.9,"tags":["median"]}
